11. Recommended implementation order for your AWS lab
1. Deploy one sample HTTP service to your existing EKS lab using the Helm chart.
2. Install Argo CD and synchronize the service from the GitOps repository.
3. Configure GitHub Actions to test, build, scan, and push immutable images.
4. Automate GitOps pull-request creation and verify the reviewed promotion updates the workload.
5. Add staging and production environments, protected branches, SSO/RBAC, secrets management, and monitoring.
6. Test rollback, node failure, pod disruption, recovery from a bad release, and database restore.